<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about emergencyplumberlansing—local plumbing service for Lansing, Grand Ledge, and surrounding Michigan communities."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>About</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>About emergencyplumberlansing</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          emergencyplumberlansing is a local plumbing business serving Lansing,
          Grand Ledge, East Lansing, Okemos, and nearby communities in Michigan.
          We focus on straightforward service: clear explanations, careful work,
          and practical solutions for everyday plumbing problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you are dealing with a sudden leak, a stubborn drain, a water
          heater that has stopped cooperating, or a planned fixture upgrade, our
          goal is the same—help you understand the issue and get it resolved
          without unnecessary complexity.
        </p>
        <h2>How We Work</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We listen to your description of the problem before recommending next steps.</li>
          <li>We explain findings in plain language and provide estimates before major work.</li>
          <li>We respect your home and leave work areas as clean as practical.</li>
          <li>We serve a defined local area so we can respond reliably.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Our Location</h2>
        <p>
          526 N Clinton St<br />
          Grand Ledge, MI 48837<br />
          USA
        </p>
        <p>
          Being based near Grand Ledge helps us reach Lansing and surrounding
          towns efficiently for both scheduled appointments and urgent needs.
        </p>
        <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
        <p>
          Reach out through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> with a
          brief description of what you need. We will follow up to discuss
          timing and next steps.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
